## Input

```css
$feature: width;
@function range-name() { @return width; }
@media ($feature + "" >=) { .missing-value {} }
.after-value { color: green; }
@media (20rem < $feature + <= 80rem) { .missing-operand {} }
.after-operand { color: green; }
@media ($feature + "" >= 40rem { .missing-close {} }
.after-close { color: green; }
@import "wide-layout.css" screen and (20rem < range-name() <=);
.after-import { color: green; }
@media (20rem < [width] <= 80rem) {}
.after-brackets { color: green; }

```


